config-connector-extensions patch 0031: mockgcp serves a folder's and a project's Security Command Center mute configs.

For securitycenter.gcp.hfl.dev SecurityCenterMuteConfig. mocksecuritycenter/muteconfig.go
took organizations/{id} as a mute config's parent only; it now takes
folders/{id} and projects/{id} too (with or without
/locations/{location}), stores each under the parent as given, and
returns that name. Whether the real API names a project's mute config
by its number is not known (live is pending).
Upstream candidate: yes.

